ce through the bug report more carefully to see what's actually happening with the dropdown options and how they relate to the encryption type selection. When the user switches from Android KeyStore back to Password/PIN on slide 2, the description on slide 3 updates correctly—but if they stay on Password/PIN, it incorrectly displays the Android KeyStore message. The root cause is that the encryption type callback fires before the fragment is created, and then onCreateView overwrites the state. My fix stores the encryption type during the callback, applies the description in onCreateView, and sets the appropriate auth method based on which encryption was selected. Let me write out the complete implementation now.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
